  "about": "Sending a security key its PIN: CTAP 2.1's authenticatorClientPIN with PIN/UV auth protocols 1 and 2, and getAssertion's pinUvAuthParam (DESIGN.md, \"A security key's PIN\"). Made by make-security-key-pin-v1.mjs with Node's own crypto. All binary values are base64; keys are uncompressed SEC1 points (04 || x || y).",
